    "done_when": "tests/test_crew_discard_reads_discarded.py passes: a run discarded through promotion.discard yields a departure whose to-state is discarded, and its run directory holds the discard record; a promoted run still yields promoted; a pointer that vanishes with neither yields withdrawn; the tests use a synthetic config home and never touch the real crew directories; the declared negative control is executed and logged under the run directory; the gate adds no failures over tests/test_a_discard_never_reads_promoted.py, tests/test_crew_recovery.py and tests/test_crew_watch_stream.py against base 9fafad1f; gate and control logs are written under the run directory, not docs/figures; the change is committed in this worktree",
